                      "name": "dbNote0",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "1. UV 必须用**日粒度去重集合**统计，不能把分钟桶相加——否则同一用户多问几次会被重复计数。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "QYPTf",
                      "name": "dbNote1",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "2. Token 口径只含大模型 prompt + completion，不含 embedding（悬空点 G-07）。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "IEXbQ",
                      "name": "dbNote2",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "3. 延时展示 P50 与 P95 两个分位（悬空点 G-08），数据源 qa_logs.elapsed_ms。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "A59hU",
                      "name": "dbNote3",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "4. 「权限拦截切片数」是本项目特有的运营指标：既反映权限配置是否过严，也提示哪些内容员工看不到。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "Tq6PF",
                      "name": "dbNote4",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "5. 看板全部读 metric_buckets 预聚合结果，禁止在查询时对 qa_logs 全表聚合。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
